"text":["但愿他早点完蛋，死在旧金山哪个没人知道的下水道里最好。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"109":{"step":[[109,110,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["加速","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"110":{"step":[[110,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一场短促的雨，正如她短促而匆忙的逃亡——雨势渐大，来得快，去得也一样快。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"111":{"step":[[111,112,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201238","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["别担心，这艘船载过很多人，虽然他们无一例外，最后全都死了——但谁又能一直活着呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"112":{"step":[[112,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201239","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“断腿”威廉被吊死前是个纵火犯，一嘴烂牙，在南安普敦上船前被仇家锯断了右腿。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"113":{"step":[[113,114,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201240","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“红手”爱德华是低地佬，喜欢用钝刀子割人质喉咙，但他却在托尔图加港被一个醉鬼抹了脖子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"114":{"step":[[114,115,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她一一回忆自己的伙伴。事情久远，但都像发生在昨天。见多识广的小船记得她的每一位乘客。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["金伯利女郎","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310011.png","audio":"612201327","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["这些人肯定都没有好下场。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"116":{"step":[[116,117,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201241","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["当然，每个人都死了。吊死的，淹死的，被船上的伙计们丢去荒岛上等死的……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"117":{"step":[[117,118,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201242","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["有船长的时候，我跟着船长的号令走，去普利茅斯，去拿骚，去皇家港……甚至装成商船在塞维利亚偷运胡椒和肉桂。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"118":{"step":[[118,119,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一段惊险的岁月，惊险而又平平无奇。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_atcg/2_2/2_2_at_zuochuan.jpg","choice":[]},"119":{"step":[[119,120,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["回忆","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"120":{"step":[[120,121,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["像十八磅加农炮留在她身上的无数个弹孔一样危险。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"121":{"step":[[121,122,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201243","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但现在，他们全都没了。可船永远是这艘船，没有船长，我也照样出航，想去哪儿就去哪儿。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"122":{"step":[[122,123,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201244","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我知道这对一个生来要服从契约的魅魔来说很难理解，但你有没有想过……过上另一种生活呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"123":{"step":[[123,124,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201245","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["喝着朗姆酒，嚼着比国王脸皮还厚的硬肉干，出海寻找那些没人见过的小岛。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"124":{"step":[[124,125,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201246","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我的意思是……好奇，就是好奇，哈哈，我也很好奇你，所以才在这儿打听。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"125":{"step":[[125,126,""]],"type":1,"name":["金伯利女郎","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310012.png","audio":"612201328","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我不知道，小船。那可能不重要，我得先……得先找到我弄丢的重要的东西。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"126":{"step":[[126,127,""]],"type":1,"name":["白朗姆","","White Rum","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310101.png","audio":"612201247","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["请叫我“船长”——伟大的白朗姆号！既是船长的船，也是船的船长！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"127":{"step":[[127,128,""]],"type":1,"name":["金伯利女郎","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"310012.png","audio":"612201329","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我可能得……等等……我有点儿……想吐……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dubaiyongheiping.jpg","choice":[]},"128":{"step":[[128,129,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":fal